    "referenceEn": "Waiting outside the interview room, Hung fidgeted anxiously with his pen and let out a slight grimace every time he checked his watch. When the recruiter stepped out and greeted him with a friendly wink, he inhaled deeply and flashed a bright grin to disguise his fear. That timely shift helped the conversation start confidently.",
