    "titleEn": "Safety Gear Before Thrilling Abseiling and Kite Surfing",
    "sourceGroup": "unit",
    "sourceLabel": "Unit 28: Tài chính, Mua sắm & Khám phá (Finance, Shopping & Nature)",
