    "referenceEn": "Thanks to finding like-minded peers in the debate club, Linh found semester exam prep much lighter. The group divided the syllabus into clear sections and worked productively for two straight weeks. Their strong bond helped everyone submit the research paper two full days ahead of the deadline.",
