    "titleEn": "[Study4 #10 • Part 3 Q5] Should parents consider their children's opinions on everything? Why?",
    "sourceGroup": "unit",
    "sourceLabel": "Unit 7: Connect (Giao tiếp & Công nghệ)",
    "unitId": "unit_7_connect_(giao_tiếp_and_công_nghệ)",
